-- READINESS SWEEP, BATCH 1 (quick fixes). Approved GJM, effective 2026-10-29.
-- From the SQF readiness review of 2026-10-29: references to the archived SOP-204 repointed to FSQM-027;
-- pecans added to the food safety plan (FSQM-016) and its step 10 rum line corrected; stale lines in
-- FSQM-005, -009, -014, -017, -036 and -039 corrected; FSQM-027's lubricant line made true (the Hobart
-- gear oil is not food-grade, FSQM-029). Archived: SOP-2.1.2 (a v1 duplicate of FSQM-005 with wrong form
-- numbers, a three-year retention and a person's name) and six empty unnumbered training placeholders.
-- FSQM-001's draft title typo corrected ("Mission and Vision").
-- Each revised document is guarded on the md5 of its content as read from production on 2026-10-29.

begin;

do $guard$
declare h text;
begin
